                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b8daa1-8082-4b2f-935c-f05495f6808a",
                                                "sense_id": "e23090ec-f651-30fa-b1f8-390ca5753843",
                                                "text": "So she invites her father and sister to a second day's dinner (if those sides, or ontrys, as she calls 'em, weren't served yesterday, I'm d—d), and to meet City folks and littery men, and keeps the Earls and the Ladies, and the Honourables to herself."
